/* PLACE “TOP” — B and B1 (talents, angels: what is given now) — build 232, translation of ru.js, same keys. */
export default {
  ui: {
    title: 'Top of the matrix — what is given now',
    lead: 'The top numbers are the positive side of the energy: the talents and strength given to a person in this life, their guardian angels. The third number from the top is about work — see below.',
    b: 'B (top)',
    b1: 'B1 (second from the top)',
  },
  text: {
    1: { about: [
      'The power of the magician. The positive side is the power of a miracle worker: you are given the power of the word and the power of thought. The energy of creativity and creation. You constantly want to be a pioneer, an innovator. The strength of a leader, the wish to lead people. Most likely the person senses the energies of the Earth and the Universe and knows how to interact with them. They love freedom and cannot stand excessive control. People who know how to create a celebration without even trying: when such a person arrives, that is it — the party has started. This is the energy of Zeus and Hermes Trismegistus.',
      'A person born under this energy has outstanding abilities, and their personal, social fulfilment matters to them. It is important for them to find the area of life where they can create something unique, something only they can make. These are innovators and leaders. They can fire others up with their ideas and lead people. From birth they are sensitive to energies and know how to use the energy potential of the Universe in what they do — earthly matters or spiritual and creative ones. They are interested in how and by what laws events materialise in their own lives and in other people’s lives.',
      'As a rule, they are optimistic and active, adventurous and inventive, full of interesting ideas. They start new projects easily. They always try to stand out from the crowd. They pass on everything they can do easily and gladly and share their experience. Life itself has put them on the front line: they often have to clear the road in life on their own, for themselves and for many others. They have a talent for reaching the heights of mastery, mostly on their own. They can work alone or with partners equal in spirit, but they cannot stand authoritarian pressure. Freedom is the main ingredient of their life.',
      'Travellers, explorers of everything new, discoverers. You can bring them into experiments — they agree easily. The celebration of life and fireworks are for them! It is much harder for them to be stuck than to be in the whirlpool of the most varied events. The whole of life is an amazing adventure that opens up before arcanum 1 if the person has managed to believe and open up to the wonderful protection of the Higher Powers in their destiny. It is like a mosaic of amazing pictures and miracles that the miracle worker creates and attracts into their life. People who come into contact with them start moving faster in their own evolution. The miracle worker accepts them only as equal partners, and only true, deep strength of spirit is an authority for them. To win the soul and heart of a miracle worker means to gain the protection, support and love of a friend. Such people have the magical power of thought, the power of the word and a wide heart. Their energy is tuned to the materialising power of the Universe! Many roads are open to them, and they will walk many of them joyfully and cheerfully!',
    ] },
    2: { about: [
      'The power of harmony. The positive side: this energy is soft and tender and helps to calm tense situations; it is so enveloping, like the veil of the Most Holy Mother of God (some clairvoyants insist that this is the energy of the Mother of God). That is why it is especially useful for such people to know at least one prayer to the Mother of God. This energy is very similar to the energy of the Virgin Mary, Hera and Hecate — when she protects you rather than being angry (an angry Hecate is arcanum 15). These people sense the world very subtly and can persuade, calm and heal with words. They do not step forward as leaders; they like to stay in the shadows, perhaps even leading from the shadows.',
      'People born under the energy of arcanum 2 have diplomatic abilities from birth: the skill of settling conflicts, smoothing sharp corners, calming outbursts of negative emotion and absorbing it with their energy. They have deep feeling and vision: they can see and notice what is hidden and lies beyond ordinary perception and understanding. Very observant, mysterious, enigmatic and careful. They show their true face to very few, often create an appearance and hide the truth from strangers’ eyes.',
      'The energy is fluid and enveloping. Like a mysterious haze over a river at dawn. Like mist spreading over the expanses of the Earth. Like clouds lying on mountain tops. I am, and I am not. I am bright, and I am unnoticed. I am captivating, and I am elusive. I am of the sun and of the moon at once. I am the very opposite of the Universe and its unity. The unity and struggle of opposites flows through the energies of arcanum 2. It is a transition from one state to another. The people are fluid and contradictory but sense everything around them very subtly, understand other people’s pain and want to help and heal.',
      'They have the ability to persuade, calm, ease pain; they are natural healers and diplomats and are drawn to everything unusual and mysterious. They read other people’s souls like the Book of Genesis. Their advice and wisdom help many. They do not rush into leading positions and most often stay neutral. They like to stay in the shadows and steer the situation quietly, carefully turning events according to their plan. They can step aside, leaving the field of battle or argument. Fuss is not for them. Their personal meditative state is precious to them, and they value and protect it. They rarely let anyone close into their personal space. They see people as equals. They love and understand nature and the animal world.',
    ] },
    3: { about: [
      'The power of the empress is the energy of Mother Earth; it embodies earthly material fertility, the energy of prosperity and earthly goods. Home, family, children, position and status in society are very important to them. They strive to take leading positions in life. This energy is reminiscent of Aphrodite, Hera and Demeter. It is very important to learn to be free of attachments, to step back from the passionate wish to possess something or someone, to be able to break away from the bustle. If you trust this energy, all the heights and blessings of the Universe are reached easily. Men with this energy understand women more easily and enjoy female company, but they need to consciously develop in themselves the qualities of arcanum 4 — the energy of the “master”, the “emperor”.',
      'Good managers and organisers. Women have extraordinary femininity and a sense of being a “queen”, an “empress”. In the Tarot, arcanum 3 is “The Empress”. This arcanum is in tune with yin, feminine energy. And that is why men whose destiny is a 3 feel comfortable and cosy in female company. They surround themselves with female attention, often like doing housework and household tasks, controlling and giving women “valuable” instructions on how to act and what to do. They understand many women’s questions and sense women better than other men. Ask such a man, “What does a woman want?” — and he will most likely answer! In the lives of such men there are always female patrons, and they keep a bond with their mother all their life. They listen to her advice and are sometimes completely led by her. A wife may also play the role of the mother. Then such men should consciously develop masculinity in themselves, build a leading, masculine, active position in life, learn to take responsibility and make decisions, and be an authority for their family and loved ones.',
      'The third energy of destiny, of fertility, is the energy of authority. As a rule, the person strives to become an authority for those around them. They quickly find themselves in the centre of attention and know how to carry others along. Material well-being, success and social position are their measure of fulfilment. They love to surround themselves with beautiful things, appreciate taste in food and clothing and know fashion. Their home is the sign and measure of their success, so the car and the house must be in perfect order and match the status of a wealthy, successful person. That is why people of the third arcanum pay special attention to order and comfort at home. If they choose a holiday, it will be in a comfortable five-star hotel. And if a girl chooses a groom, she will prefer a well-off man who already has a position in society, or a promising one with great prospects.',
      'People of the third arcanum have a natural love for themselves and know how to care for their body, as for their home and children. They know how to run a household well and manage money sensibly. Responsible and reliable, they keep an eye on all their loved ones and often try to solve their problems for them. God gives such women outer beauty, attractiveness and femininity. They know how to earn money: money comes to them and is drawn to them. Their own business works out for them. They feel good wherever big money circulates. At their best they are broad-minded, kind and generous. They respond readily to requests for help. Their purpose and aim in life is to create on the material plane of the Earth, so that life becomes richer and more fertile in all its earthly forms; to provide people with decent material prosperity and living standards in any area of the material world. So that the people of the planet love the Earth, love earthly goods, are prosperous and successful and treat Mother Earth and everything she gives with gratitude.',
    ] },
    4: { about: [
      'The power of the emperor. The positive side: masculine, yang energy, the energy of fire — powerful, all-consuming and effective. The energy of making decisions and taking on responsibility. The ability to answer not only for oneself but for many. The energy opens great opportunities and horizons on the road of power and social position. This is the energy of Zeus and Ares.',
      '“You are a man — so you are fire, and if you are fire, you are strong; but your inner fire must not burn: it is meant to give warmth, to make a hearth and to gather everyone round it to warm themselves.” Women feel protected by this energy, as by a father or husband, but it is very important for them to keep their femininity and softness — they need to learn to be strong in a feminine way.',
      'Arcanum 4 is the leading principle of rule and power on Earth. Whoever is given the energy of power by destiny has great opportunities and horizons on the road of power and social position. These people are hard-working and responsible and strive to put everything in order and under their influence. The ability to line people up, give tasks and ask for results. Natural managerial and organising abilities. An interest in political and state structures of power and, as a result, frequent involvement in them. Life itself seems to push such a person to the front, handing them all the mechanisms of rule. And whether these are small companies or large state structures, the person of number four tends to put things in order everywhere and organise the processes in any business. People say of them, “A born leader!” The energy of arcanum 4 is stable and unshakeable. Once the person has made a decision, they intend to follow it to the end, moving forward steadily and confidently. Brilliant logic helps them reach the goal. Everything in their head is structured and sorted. People of arcanum 4 are marked by reliability and a strong shoulder they are ready to offer in hard times. The strength of a warrior, masculine strength, decisiveness, the ability to make important decisions and find a way out of difficult situations, faith in success, no fuss or panic — all this describes arcanum 4 at its best.',
      'If a woman has arcanum 4 in her destiny, she should work on her femininity, consciously lowering the vibration of the energy to arcanum 3. Be aware of her masculine leadership abilities and become softer and more fluid, freer and more relaxed, like feminine energy (study arcanum 3 well). Your destiny bears the sign of a strong man, a protector. Such women feel comfortable in male company. They often dress like men, wear their hair short, prefer a sporty style, do masculine kinds of work and choose masculine professions. “Bring up the woman in yourself,” arcanum 4 tells them, “and trust a strong man who rightfully takes the place of the leader in your life.”',
    ] },
    5: { about: [
      'The energy of the teacher, of “law”. Everything to do with lawfulness, order, all kinds of rules and traditions is in tune with arcanum 5. People with destiny number 5 try to live by rules and traditions: family traditions, the laws of society and religion. Everything established by authorities or by themselves matters to them. In life they look for knowledge confirmed by scientific research — this proves their choice right and gives them peace. It is hard for them to embark on adventures: their principles will not allow it. Family and raising children play a big role in their lives. They generally love to teach, explain and educate, because nature gave them the talent of teaching, eloquence and persuasion. They love to convince people they are right and sincerely believe their opinion and judgement are definitely correct and that there are no other ways or solutions. People of arcanum 5 are excellent speakers; public speaking comes easily to them and they learn oratory easily. Speaking to an audience is their path. They are interested in scientific approaches to any task: think it through logically and calculate, see and convince. They love to study and gain knowledge all their life. To be in a team, to take the positions of leader and manager. Having learnt something, they gladly share that knowledge with others. It is important to them to convey their thoughts and beliefs to people.',
      'Reliable, responsible, fond of order, able to lead or manage, and gifted with eloquence and teaching, people of arcanum 5 live by their clear beliefs and principles, often boxing themselves into the frames of their own logical thinking and vision. Sometimes they do not manage to change their views as fast as life changes, because their settled principles slow them down, creating obstacles, frames and narrowness of vision. It is very important for them to revise their views and work on expanding their consciousness. To be able to accept the world and life in all its variety, different points of view and positions, and to experiment more often in ways that renew life. To trust the Universe unconditionally, as guidance and protection. They are always devoted to and protect all those they love, care for and help. They are an authority for those around them. Independent and active. The energy is like Cronus, the father of Zeus.',
    ] },
    6: { about: [
      'This is the energy of communication, connection and sensuality. This arcanum governs our feelings and emotions. People with the energy of arcanum 6 communicate easily and get on easily with people; they have many friends and acquaintances, they are sweet, pleasant and courteous. They try to win people over, settle conflicts and smooth sharp corners. They are drawn to everything bright, beautiful and elegant; they appreciate art and beauty and have excellent refined taste. They are often gourmets and connoisseurs of everything beautiful. Love is an inseparable part of life for them. It matters to them to love everything they do, everything their attention is directed at. They try to surround themselves with beautiful things, pleasant people and prestigious work. They pay special attention to outer form, and that is why they have excellent taste. They set the fashion in everything. They tend to see beauty in everything and strive to live up to their own principles and feelings. They take care of themselves and their appearance and choose their clothes carefully.',
      'You will never send a child with destiny 6 out to play in something they do not want to wear or do not like: they may throw a tantrum, but they will not go out to people looking “ugly”. For such people the opinion of others is very important: what people will say, what they will think, how they will look in others’ eyes, what impression they will make.',
      'They are artistic by nature. They love to enjoy life and bask in the energy of adoration and love. Wherever they are, they easily attract attention and easily become the life and soul of any company. Emotional and quick to fall in love, they like making others fall in love with them. They dive into relationships completely, head first, living all the emotions vividly. Their home usually has a cosy and beautiful atmosphere; they love having guests and are warm hosts. They also gladly take part in any celebrations and parties. They love to eat and have fun. All the pleasures of the world of forms, the pleasures of the body, are for them. They know how to create a celebration around themselves and so are rarely alone. Loneliness is not for them. An atmosphere of fireworks, celebration, beauty and company is what marks arcanum 6. That is why they feel sad and bored when all this is missing from their life for long. They need to draw these energies from the outer world — and, of course, learn to create them within themselves!',
    ] },
    7: { about: [
      'Movement and victory. This is yang energy, the energy of a warrior striving for victory and for the goal they have set. Your guardian angel is very strong, like Hermes. You are given the energy of a warrior, a winner. You have great potential and can lead people. I call this the energy of Olympic champions; the only problem is that you need to learn to relax, because the body’s capacities are still somewhat limited, the body needs rest, and you may forget about it…',
      'People with a clear leading position and the energy of a warrior. They are independent and solve the questions of their life themselves: they are the ones who drive the chariot of their destiny. It is important for them to understand and know the final goal; they are focused on results. Making business plans for the near future helps people of arcanum 7 a great deal: it makes it easier to concentrate and direct their energy where it is needed, avoiding useless actions. Movement is the main principle of these people. As a rule, they drive any kind of vehicle well, love to travel, are quick to get going, optimistic and active in life. But they can become militant if they start dividing the world into good and evil, black and white, and refuse to understand the laws of the universe.',
      'A lack of action and movement leads to stagnation in their life and in their physical body, so they need to train not only the spirit but also the body: strengthen the skeleton and keep the joints flexible. Such people are often workaholics, so they need to learn relaxation and meditation, alternate activity with rest and be able to relax the mind and the physical body. Fitness, physical exercise and active holidays are for them. They know how to fire others up with their ideas, lead them and become an example to follow, because they are active and energetic. Their own fulfilment is very important to them. An aimless life is not for them. Such people are persistent and determined and can start what they planned again and again, even after failure, each time hoping for a positive outcome and that the goal will be reached. Decisive, they do not hesitate for long: once they have decided, they act.',
    ] },
    8: { about: [
      '“Justice”, “balance”. Turn the figure eight on its side and it means infinity, so the roots of destiny code 8 go far into the past, and people of code 8 are bound by invisible energy threads to the karma of past lives. It is they who are given to see, feel and understand the karmic law of justice more deeply and subtly. What we see when an event happens is the consequence of emotions, thoughts and actions we lived through earlier. What we have in reality did not come to us by chance, and so nothing ever happens to us just like that: it is all the law of cause and effect. And it is easier for people of arcanum 8 to understand this law, to see it in the events of their own life and later to learn to see it in other people’s lives too.',
      'People of arcanum 8 keep asking themselves: “Why is this happening to me? What is the true cause of these problems? And what can I do today so that my life changes in the future?” They are given to work constantly on improving their karma. They are interested in various methods of improving destiny and attend all kinds of trainings and seminars. In everyday life they are very responsible, always try to act fairly and demand fairness from others, so they can be hot-tempered and easily hurt. They get involved in every dispute and stand up for the weak. They are open, friendly and fearless and can react quickly in difficult situations. In extreme conditions they act decisively. You can rely on them and entrust them with responsible work. They often find their place in legislative bodies and in law enforcement, supervision and tax services.',
      'It is important for them to understand the true karmic law so as not to react so strongly to its consequences in everyday life. To try not to interfere where it is not needed. By studying the laws of the universe, people of code 8 can bring clarity to any situation, even a difficult one. They can help, because they are always oriented towards help and support. Learning to recognise the truth is their main karmic task.',
    ] },
    9: { about: [
      'The energy of healing and inner wisdom. It is very important for such people to study some practices (this applies to everything, even cooking), to repeat after someone so that later they “remember” how to do it their own way. And this way of their own will be far more valuable than all the clever truths in books.',
      'You know how to find the right word, give useful advice, listen and comfort. Healing abilities are given to you from birth — healing with words. So use this gift for the good of all. Watch your speech: let the words you say heal, not wound. It is important for you sometimes to be in silence, alone with nature, but do not overdo it, do not shut yourself away and do not leave people for long. You can become receptive to the energies of the Universe if you learn to meditate and talk directly to God, to the Higher Powers. Then new knowledge will come to you that you can use for people. Develop not only thought but also intuition and the sensing of energies.',
      'People with destiny arcanum 9 are self-sufficient and naturally wise. Everyone always turns to them for advice and listens to them; their opinion always carries weight. Such people do not like noisy company. They have a philosophical view of life. They love to go deep into whatever they study. Unhurried and calm. They are fine on their own and never bored. They love to read and learn new things. Science comes to them more easily than to others — they are the first in research. They always respond to other people’s pain and know how to listen and guide a person out of a difficult situation. They make excellent healers of soul and body. They choose a partner very thoroughly and, when they fall in love, usually stay faithful for a long time. The depth of their feelings and soul is hidden from view, so they seem dry and reserved, but that is not so: they are tender, caring and sympathetic — they simply cannot open their soul to everyone. They love solitude and time to think: it is in solitude that the sage’s most intimate thoughts and insights come. In solitude such people rest and restore the energy they have spent. It can be very important for them to be alone, and there is no need to disturb them or take offence: they will “come out to people” themselves when they are ready. To win the heart and friendship of a sage is to gain a reliable friend ready to help in any trial. People of arcanum 9 do not strive for leadership, but they are responsible about the duties given to them.',
      'They are meticulous and attentive in any matter. They are in no hurry to marry: first they want to stand on their own feet, become financially secure and get an education. Late marriages are most common among such people. They love nature and animals and enjoy walking their pets. Time in nature also gives them energy. People of arcanum 9 love to write down their philosophical thoughts, which is why there are often poets, writers and artists among them. If something captures such a person, they can master anything once they give it their time and thought. They are quite versatile in any kind of work, and still their wisdom and brilliant mind help them grasp any task, even one that is very hard for many others. They study well, love learning all their life and also teach others well. Among them there are also hermits, people who have gone to a monastery to escape the bustle and routine of life and the world of forms. They may lead an ascetic life and give up bodily and material pleasures.',
    ] },
    10: { about: [
      'People of arcanum 10 are considered “lucky ones”, “fortune’s favourites”. They are born with protectors from above assigned to them (or, you could say, guardian angels). All their life they feel that life itself protects them and leads them out of any situation, even a very difficult one. It is as if they are in the flow of destiny itself: they only need to make a decision, and everything around them starts spinning in that flow. The right doors open, the right people appear exactly when it matters. Information turns up that leads to a good result, and so on. It is as if life itself talks to these people, constantly giving them signs of its presence. And so much comes easily to people of arcanum 10, unless they tend to complicate their life and tangle the wheel of their fortune, trying to spin it backwards or even swim against the current.',
      'When a person swims against the current, they lose a lot of energy and life stops opening up to them. That is why arcanum 10 needs to learn to feel their flow and choose it consciously. Only with developed intuition and an expanded consciousness can you feel life itself and see the signs along the way. Life always speaks to us through signs. People with the destiny energy of “flow” do not strive to take leading positions in life. They work superbly in a team, because their energy helps any project or enterprise move forward more easily. Such people are sociable, quick to get going and gladly join in any company. Adventurous, open to suggestion and influence.',
      'They need to learn to take life lightly and gain a positive view of the world — and their wheel of destiny, their fateful flow will always guide them towards a favourable course of destiny and the fulfilment of their divine purpose.',
    ] },
    11: { about: [
      'For such people strength is an expression of their individuality: they perceive the world from a position of strength. Strength of spirit, of thought, of the word, of divine love, physical strength and so on. Their life shows peaks of enormous rises and then equally deep falls, because it is impossible to stay on the crest of the wave, at the peak of strength, all the time. The world is cyclical, and so if such people do not learn to use the strength they are given, life may bring enough lessons, tasks and sharp corners for them to learn to manage their energies, emotions and thoughts. Their strength may at times be directed outwards and at times inwards. And depending on what kind of strength it is, they can create and destroy not only the world around them but also themselves. Any negative expressions of strength should be turned into the strength of divine love and acceptance of the world and people as they are. Tame the passion within yourself, tame the wild beast — and you will be given to bring good to many, because you have enough strength.',
      'These people have great energy potential, hence great capacity for action. People of arcanum 11 are often workaholics: they always need to be doing something and cannot stay passive for long. They do strength sports and sport in general, fitness. They often find their calling as fitness and sports instructors. In their free time they love active rest, but they should learn meditativeness and relaxation so that their strength becomes softer and more creative. People of arcanum 11 cannot stand pressure from outside; they start defending themselves and the “force against force” reflex kicks in. That is why at times they can be arrogant, hot-tempered and cheeky. But on the whole they have a cheerful nature, an open soul and noble deeds. They can take responsibility and lead people; the energy of leadership is strong in them. Resilient in defeat, with a steady drive and determination to win. A high pain threshold.',
    ] },
    12: { about: [
      'People of arcanum 12 are marked by the divine law of service. They have a particular task: to bring more kindness, mercy and compassion into life. To teach people to be like that, to be an example of selfless giving of love, help and support to the world. A person of arcanum 12 sees many questions of life differently (in the Tarot, arcanum 12 is a man hanging upside down, which means his angle of view on the world and situations is the opposite of people standing on their feet). That is why their innovative view teaches others to think and perceive life differently. All kinds of new ideas, projects and fields of activity are open to them. They are a treasure trove of unusual information. How much interesting you can learn talking to a person of arcanum 12! Life seems to take on other colours and shapes.',
      'Such people are always focused on mutual help and support; many turn to them for help, sensing their responsive heart and open soul. The main thing for them is to remember themselves behind other people’s problems, to show themselves care, love and attention. To spoil themselves at times, give themselves gifts, arrange celebrations. After all, life is given to us for pleasure, joy, happiness and prosperity, not for suffering and self-sacrifice. It is very important for them not to fall into self-sacrifice towards any people or circumstances. To know when to get out of dependence and a state of limbo. To be able to say “no” and stand up for themselves, because their kind, soft heart sometimes pushes them into acts that harm themselves, as long as they benefit others.',
      'Self-love, self-discipline and spiritual growth help arcanum 12 go through all of life’s lessons and become wiser. They love to learn and discover something unusual, interesting and special in life. It is important for them to learn to let go of the old, not to cling to people, situations and circumstances, not to “hang” in old emotions. To step boldly into change. Then their life will gain a more progressive meaning, movement will begin, and the person will surely grasp their purpose under arcanum 12 and find their own, and only their own, unique, unconventional path that will benefit many. After all, a different view is always the beginning of change.',
    ] },
    13: { about: [
      'People of this arcanum are mystical and unpredictable by the nature of their destiny. At times they are incomprehensible even to themselves. People perceive them ambiguously, because their power of transformation and change can always be felt, and not everyone is ready to meet it. These people can cause and create change and renewal everywhere around them. Wherever they appear, they help old foundations and forms be reborn into new, more progressive ones. Everything outdated must leave the universe and be transformed in the evolutionary flow of life. If a person is not ready for change — and change is inevitable and comes suddenly — it is not always painless for them, and so people of arcanum 13 are able to launch irreversible processes of necessary transformation, of overdue change. They themselves cannot stay stuck in the same situation for long or do dull, monotonous work. They need strong surges of feeling and emotion and a constant interest in life. They are very curious and creative. They easily withstand difficult extreme situations: in an emergency they quickly pull themselves together, focus and act without delay or panic. The philosophy of life and death is their inner philosophy and natural state of being. They understand the rhythms of the cycles on Earth like no one else. And once they cut off the old, they do not return to it but begin new cycles of life.',
      'People of arcanum 13 have decisiveness, courage and fearlessness. They are bold, very active, capable of heroic deeds and bursts of feeling. Their life shows cycles: some states change into their opposites after a while, like the breathing of life itself, like the change of seasons, like life and death. They themselves need to accept all the cycles of their life spiritually and keep tuning in to the wave of positivity, joy and happiness — to the happy wave. They are born rescuers and adrenaline seekers; their fear of death is dulled: they understand its philosophy and, as a rule, are not afraid of what is connected with it. Fearlessness is a trait of their character. Helping people change, drawing spiritual lessons from hardship, letting go of the old and breaking up stuck situations is their mission on Earth, their purpose. And showing people the path of change.',
    ] },
    14: { about: [
      'People of arcanum 14 feel and perceive the world, people and events with great subtlety. They have a rich emotional and inner world and a mature soul. They are receptive to everything beautiful and need to nourish themselves with the energies of art. That is why they love spending time in museums, theatres and concerts and going to creative evenings. They are keen on dance, painting, music, theatre and cinema. The range of interests of arcanum 14 is very rich and varied. They are intellectual, easily keep up a conversation, are usually well read and know a lot. Poetry and history interest them too. They may themselves choose work connected with the arts. Foreign languages come easily to them, and as a rule they have contacts abroad or travel to different countries.',
      'Besides art, people of arcanum 14 have developed abilities for healing people, most often by natural means. They know herbs and methods of cleansing the body and like to use all this on themselves. They are sensible about food and try to lead a healthy lifestyle. In the Tarot, arcanum 14 is the card of Temperance, and people of arcanum 14 learn to tame all their inner passions: through cleansing, fasting, prayer and abstinence. They try to move away from bodily temptations, strengthening the spirit. In communication they try first of all to see the person’s soul, their essence, and only then their appearance. The inner matters more to them than the outer, though beauty of form and aesthetic taste are part of them: they are subtle connoisseurs of everything beautiful. Their healing element is water. It is good for such people to be in contact with water more often and take water treatments; hydrotherapy helps them well. From birth they have a connection with their guardian angel, and so their intuition and extrasensory perception are developed. They make good healers. Their character is balanced, kind and, in the positive, open. They can take leading positions but do not particularly strive for it: being in the creative process of life matters more to them than leading. People who love nature and animals.',
    ] },
    15: { about: [
      'People of arcanum 15 are gifted with great potential of energy and opportunity. They are given the vision of human weaknesses. Such a person is like an X-ray: they look and see right through where something is imperfect and what should be worked through and spiritually healed. And without knowing it, they try to provoke a person into exposing this negativity, so that the person can see for themselves where their weaknesses and imperfections still lie. People of arcanum 15 have the mission of testing readiness for the transition to the energies of the spirit, because it is with arcanum 15 that the spiritual seven of fateful energies begins (arcana 1 to 7 are the seven of matter, 8 to 14 the seven of the soul, 15 to 21 the seven of the spirit, and arcanum 22 is the transitional one connecting spirit with matter). That is why people of arcanum 15 have a special mission: not to let the weak and unready climb higher, because falling from a height is dangerous for them — they will not be able to hold on up there. So we should always understand what in ourselves makes us unready to hold on at a particular height, and arcanum 15 is called to tempt a person and test their strength.',
      'People of arcanum 15 often act as those who provoke and test, who push or offer temptation. Through them your weak spots are pointed out to you. Make friends with a person of arcanum 15 and you will learn everything about yourself: where you are still weak and imperfect. That is why not everyone can be with these people all the time. People relate to them in different ways: some love and respect them, some get angry, some keep away and are afraid, and some instinctively shut themselves off, fearing that something will start happening that they are not ready to face. On the whole these people are cheerful, energetic, sociable and ready for adventurous escapades. They know how to manage situations and other people and how to turn events their way. They love earthly pleasures and know how to attract good things into their life. Everything chic, rich and glamorous is for them.',
    ] },
    16: { about: [
      'The essence of arcanum 16 is insight, a change of view on the usual way of life, on everything that previously seemed unchangeable. Everything is transformed in the energies of destiny code 16. A new vision and understanding allows a person to begin a new, changed life, more conscious and spiritual. This does not mean that circumstances change at once: simply the view of them changes, the attitude to them changes, acceptance comes. The energy of code 16 carries the transformation and destruction of everything that slows a person down and leads them away from their purpose. And people of code 16 help others awaken spiritually. Destroying an old vision and worldview is their God-given ability. To bring change to habitual forms and a stagnant way of life, to show the destructive power of earthly hooks and attachments, of emotional dependencies.',
      'In the course of their life they walk their own path of ascent to the spirit, receiving hard lessons from destiny for their own transformation and awakening. They often have to begin new cycles; life never stands still. Something is always happening, and if the person has learnt to understand the events of life correctly, by all the karmic laws, they come out as winners even from the most difficult situations, gaining even greater strength of spirit and stability. They are strong in energy and spirit — otherwise it is impossible to cope with the powerful energies of 16: it is given to them by destiny, as a given of their purpose. They can be “explosive”, sharp and impulsive. But their kind heart and their wish to help, to show and explain to people the way out to the light make them glowing lights in any darkness. In any night a person of code 16 can lead others out to the light, to a new vision and awakening. A leading energy able to lead people. Such a person can see the way to change in ordinary everyday matters too. They love taking part in any reconstruction and restructuring. From them you can expect unusual creative solutions and an innovative approach to any task.',
    ] },
    17: { about: [
      'People of arcanum 17 are star people with a vivid originality. They are marked by heaven from birth. Heaven and the Higher Powers watch over them, protect and keep them and give them energy to express themselves in life. It may be any kind of creativity, or simply brightness in general, even in everyday affairs and chores. Such a person cannot go unnoticed; you want to single them out. They are interesting to talk to, and people are drawn to them because they feel their positive influence. Heaven makes such people its conductors of energy. They have a close bond with nature. They are responsive and open. They have hands that can heal — or else whatever they do, if they do it with love, turns out well. A person through whom Heavenly energy flows, as through a conductor, is called a star person, that is, one who has a connection with their star.',
      'And if they go deep into some occupation, they can rise in it to the height of a star and be noticed by many: after all, a star shines in the sky and thousands can look at it. People of arcanum 17 are receptive, sensitive, intuitive and extrasensory. They often have vivid and prophetic dreams. They have a rich imagination and fantasy; sometimes people tell them, “Come down to earth and stop living in the clouds.” The energy of the star enchants and fascinates; the main thing for them is to find their path, discover their talent and understand their calling in life and creativity — then the energy of heaven can flow through them at full strength. Faith in oneself, self-love and a connection with heaven are important ingredients of their success. “Star” people can carry the state of a joyful, enthusiastic child through their whole life. They are talented in any art they take up seriously.',
    ] },
    18: { about: [
      'People of destiny energy 18 are mystical and magnetic by nature. They have a rich inner world; the depth of such a person is fascinating. They are people of mystery. They have a rich imagination and well-developed intuition. They often have prophetic dreams and an energy connection with the Moon, so lunar cycles directly affect their life and health: when the moon is waxing, their potential grows; when it is waning, there may be less energy. But these people are strong in energy all the same. At the full moon their most powerful potential comes to them. The Moon is a huge magnet in the Universe, and so people of the Moon are likewise able to attract into their life whatever they concentrate on, that is, whatever they think about for a while. They have the strongest materialising ability of all the energies of destiny. That is why such people need to understand this and watch the thoughts they dwell on for long: they can attract all of it into their life and create that reality for themselves. And it is good if it is a bright reality — but what if not? So such people need to learn to stay positive. Positive thinking is the path to success in life.',
      'Such people are interested in everything mysterious, unusual and mystical. Among people of the Moon there are more mystics, magicians and seers than anywhere else; they often turn their abilities into a profession. The Moon governs magic, ritual and ceremony. In everyday life the Moon gives people artistic abilities, a rich creative imagination, a good memory and a feel for situations and people. They have a close bond with their Heavenly protectors and so believe in higher powers and miracles. A person of arcanum 18 can find fulfilment in any area of life; they are very versatile, but still drawn to something unusual, to creating beauty and to art. They have a natural gift for writing. The Moon is a yin, attracting energy, under the patronage of the element of water. So it is good for people of the Moon to be in contact with water more often: to spend time near water, to heal and cleanse the physical body with water, to watch the body’s water balance and drink clean water during the day. They must not sink into depression for long. They should grow spiritually so that the dark, negative Moon cannot pull them in.',
    ] },
    19: { about: [
      'People of arcanum 19 have the ability to shine, which means to give their creative abilities and energy potential to the world and to people unconditionally. They are very open and have powerful energy. The Sun shines in the sky on everyone without choosing anyone: it simply is and rises in the sky constantly, and people choose for themselves whether to come out to the sun and actively join the day that has begun. That is why people of the Sun attract many people around them. The energies of the collective are at work in their destiny. They quickly win recognition and draw attention to themselves. A clearly leading position. The Sun cannot stay in the shade for long: everyone will notice it once it comes out from behind the horizon or a cloud. Such people usually have global tasks: they set them for themselves and act very actively to achieve them. They are positive and rarely fall into despair or depression; sadness is not for them. They can get upset when they go a long time without active, creative work. Their life is bustling activity in everything: with the first rays of the sun at dawn, everything must switch into active work.',
      'And so they cannot understand how other people can do nothing, not be active, not strive for anything; such an attitude depresses them. But they should accept people as they are: not everyone is meant to be the sun, everyone has different energies by destiny. The Sun has the most active yang energy, the energy of action. That is why the Universe usually places serious, important, global tasks on these people: to create, to spread knowledge, light, kindness, love, beauty, healing, warmth and joy. How joyful it is to see the sun in the sky: the soul sings and everything around takes on bright colours. Only people of arcanum 19 should understand their strong influence on others. If the sun shines on one spot for a while, whatever it shines on will catch fire and burn up from the enormous power of the energy of fire. So clinging to one person, to one life situation, is extremely harmful for them: instead of kindness and love, they may do harm without realising it. Their energy must be spread over many. This means they should have an active occupation in life, to spend all their main energy there, and let their loved ones at home receive the warm rays of a sun that does not scorch. Can you shut the sun inside four walls? It is impossible. If you do, the person begins to feel unwell from lack of fulfilment and unspent energy — a kind of self-burning happens. So such people should make sure their energy goes into public activity or the creative process. They should be given plenty of work so that they feel useful to people. The Sun is meant to shine!',
    ] },
    20: { about: [
      'People of destiny energy 20 have the ability to receive information from the universal information field and pass it on to the world as conductors of energy. They are mystical by nature and have a close connection with heaven, that is, they are extrasensory and intuitive. They have prophetic dreams and flashes of clarity, when an unusual thought seems to come into their head — clearly not from logical thinking — and they are surprised: “How do I know this?!” People of arcanum 20 are born healers: they sense energies and can heal. They are bound by a common karma with their ancestors, that is, by a common karmic task, and therefore during their life they are to work it off, that is, to heal the karma of their family line: to try to live differently, not the way their ancestors and parents lived. In the Tarot, arcanum 20 is the trumpet between heaven and earth, between the world of the living and the world of the dead, and so deceased relatives may come to them in dreams and give information. They understand the philosophy of life and death. As a rule, they are not afraid of death and can work in fields connected with it.',
      'They are interested in everything unusual and unexplained. They often find their place in information structures. They are strong in energy and have heavenly guidance and protection from birth. From the very beginning of life they feel that God exists. They love spiritual growth and study the laws of the universe. These are capable people: if they develop their ability to pass on information, they will be able to pass on the information of the new age to the people of the planet. In everyday life they are well-rounded, with a wide range of interests and hobbies. It is very important for them to give up aggression, to learn to forgive and to learn not to judge people. Not to divide the world into good and evil. To move away from harshness and excessive pressure and control over loved ones. To come to positive thinking, because their thoughts materialise very quickly. Heaven hears them!',
    ] },
    21: { about: [
      'People born in the energies of arcanum 21 have by nature a deep connection with all of existence, with everything around them, with the whole world. They feel deeply, perceive subtly and are peace-loving. They are natural healers of souls and diplomats. They can settle conflicts and in their thoughts aim at global tasks. They are interested in everything, not only on the scale of their personal life but on the scale of the country, the whole Earth and the Universe: history, world politics, world religions and so on. They feel the presence and guidance of higher powers from early childhood. They believe that everything is possible and rarely limit their plans, hopes and dreams. They want to bring good to many people, and they truly aim for it. Selflessly and with an open heart they are inspired by bright ideas and ideals. They can lead many people if they direct all their bright potential towards good aims, deeds and tasks.',
      'By their very nature the borders of the world are open to such people. As a rule, foreign languages come easily to them and they travel a lot around the world. They choose work connected with international ties: either trips abroad or companies with influence on the whole world. Our whole planet is home to them: they feel good wherever they are and adapt quickly and easily to different climates. Such people are extrasensory and can heal others with the energies of the Universe. Information often comes to them from a universal source. They meditate easily. They are often destined to take part in global projects, putting a strong share of their energy, strength and will into them. People of number 21 have moved world processes and left their mark on history. For people of arcanum 21 the unity of all the people of the planet matters, and the spiritual motto “Peace throughout the world” is close to them. The unity of all people. All people are kindred souls!',
    ] },
    22: { about: [
      'People free of dogmas and limits, of any frames and prohibitions. Arcanum 22, like 21, perceives the world as a whole. Its heart, will and mind serve universal love and world tasks that open the way to freedom, flight and dreams. “Soar above any limits, feel the taste of true freedom,” says arcanum 22. “Let wings grow on my back and I will fly over the world, see its breadth, see the seas and my native expanses, the grandeur of mountains, beauty. I will see all that I am given to see and give it to people with love. Will you respond to this knowledge? And I am grateful to you.” Arcanum 22 is a wanderer covering road after road, a bundle over the shoulder, in loose linen clothes. It is the image of a vagabond before whom all the borders of the world are open. Travellers, enlightened teachers. Performers, minstrels, jesters; light, comic roles suit performers of arcanum 22. For such people freedom is the fundamental inner principle. It is useless to box them in and try to restrict them: they will drop everything and still go their own way. They see life as an adventure, a road, a path — light and free, to be walked cheerfully, laughing in the face of hardship and sorrow.',
      'People with an open heart and soul. They can carry the light of freedom from limits, like messengers of light. Their whole life is a firework of events, many contacts and friends. They get on easily with people. They love nature and are perfectly happy with a holiday in a tent and a night by the fire under the stars, where the whole sky and the whole Universe are beside them, watching over and protecting them. They understand the cycles of life, the end of one stage and the beginning of the next; as a rule, they do not cling to earthly goods. Spiritual matters stand above everyday worldly fuss for them. All religions are one for them, all people are one, the whole Earth is home. Creative natures, receptive and intuitive. It is hard for them to stay in one place for long: they are drawn by the dust of earthly roads and the heights of heaven. To rejoice in every moment of life is the image of arcanum 22; to lead people to true freedom, to the heights of the spirit, are their true wishes and aspirations. Life in lightness, the path in lightness, the moment in lightness — that is all arcanum 22. Adventurous, stepping easily into the unknown, easily starting new cycles and ventures, opening new roads, brave merrymakers who trust the Creator unconditionally and feel his harmony with them, his protection and guidance in every moment of life — that is arcanum 22, and it gives it an extraordinary strength of spirit!',
    ] },
  },
};
